{"3531220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MECHBORN", "steam_appid": 3531220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/106cb94001996b7a1848a6d59d5e9f78.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1262 height=363 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f3acb8dc2ce7f61d0910b28ca61fd34c.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1280 height=121 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mech Is Your Deck</strong> - Swap Mech parts to change the cards in your starting deck and unlock new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never Run Out Of Cards</strong> - Avoid wasted turns by always having 7 cards to play from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Position Matters</strong> - Activate powerful buffs when positioning them next to ‘support’ cards or slots in the conveyor belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Mech &amp; Pilot Synergies</strong> - Unlock 3 mechs and 5 pilots, each with their own unique skills and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Freely With No Fixed Paths</strong> – Decide when to push forward or backtrack to safety across 3 ever-changing maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ways To Play</strong> - Campaign, Daily Challenges, Custom battles or fight to sit atop the leaderboard in Swarm Mode!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth reels under an unrelenting Kaiju assault. In response, TITANCORE forges the '<strong>MECHBORN</strong>' - elite pilots strong enough to endure the brutal toll of 'Mech-Synchronization'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MECHBORN</strong> features <strong>3 Mechs</strong>, each having <strong>3 unique armour</strong> sets to unlock across 4 slots: Head, Chest, Arms &amp; Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part you equip <strong>adds new cards to your starting deck</strong>, so how you build your mech directly shapes how you play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a matching set to <strong>unlock distinct playstyles</strong> with powerful starting combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix and match parts</strong> across sets to craft custom decks that suits your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different - swap parts between runs, with <strong>endless synergies to discover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MECHBORN</strong> replaces the traditional hand of cards with the <strong>Conveyor Belt: a flowing queue of 7 cards</strong> to fuel countless possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new card slides in every time one is played, so you <strong>never run out of options</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always plan ahead - with <strong>7 cards always available</strong>, your next move is never a mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use pilot skills to reposition cards</strong> - setting up devastating combos before you need them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f2bbbe62ce955b3b5eea8cc6b285d67f.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f2bbbe62ce955b3b5eea8cc6b285d67f.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f2bbbe62ce955b3b5eea8cc6b285d67f.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Conveyor Belt, where a card sits is just as important as what it does:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack and Defence cards</strong> form the backbone of your combat - but their output can change depending on which slot they're played from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support cards are entirely ‘position dependent’</strong> - some thrive on constant movement, others demand stillness, and some hit their peak when placed next to Attack or Defence cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot skills let you reposition cards mid-combat</strong> - set up the conveyor belt with precision to unleash devastating combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/63f56e8f94e2ace433c39571641aaccd.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/63f56e8f94e2ace433c39571641aaccd.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/63f56e8f94e2ace433c39571641aaccd.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an <strong>ever-changing map</strong> across 3 continents – Where you go, when you upgrade and how deep you explore is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push deeper or backtrack</strong> – carefully decide how you balance fuel, health and credits or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy, remove &amp; upgrade cards</strong> – Discover shops and vendors, then revisit when you need to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions scattered across the map may offer aid</strong> — or look to stand in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned labs hide powerful Infusers</strong> that can transform your Mech's capabilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings a different map, different encounters and different decisions for you to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/79a498ab54ac1377e152cc5eb940e95a.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/79a498ab54ac1377e152cc5eb940e95a.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/79a498ab54ac1377e152cc5eb940e95a.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pilot has <strong>4 unique combat skills</strong>, powered up with each card you play - the more you play, the more powerful your pilot becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reposition, transform and copy cards mid-fight</strong> to reshape the conveyor belt in your favour, or <strong>unleash devastating attacks</strong> at the perfect moment to turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f3acb8dc2ce7f61d0910b28ca61fd34c.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1280 height=121 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mech Is Your Deck</strong> - Swap Mech parts to change the cards in your starting deck and unlock new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never Run Out Of Cards</strong> - Avoid wasted turns by always having 7 cards to play from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Position Matters</strong> - Activate powerful buffs when positioning them next to ‘support’ cards or slots in the conveyor belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Mech &amp; Pilot Synergies</strong> - Unlock 3 mechs and 5 pilots, each with their own unique skills and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Freely With No Fixed Paths</strong> – Decide when to push forward or backtrack to safety across 3 ever-changing maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ways To Play</strong> - Campaign, Daily Challenges, Custom battles or fight to sit atop the leaderboard in Swarm Mode!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth reels under an unrelenting Kaiju assault. In response, TITANCORE forges the '<strong>MECHBORN</strong>' - elite pilots strong enough to endure the brutal toll of 'Mech-Synchronization'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/5c060eb8111d69548dc1f30a27409888.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MECHBORN</strong> features <strong>3 Mechs</strong>, each having <strong>3 unique armour</strong> sets to unlock across 4 slots: Head, Chest, Arms &amp; Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part you equip <strong>adds new cards to your starting deck</strong>, so how you build your mech directly shapes how you play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a matching set to <strong>unlock distinct playstyles</strong> with powerful starting combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix and match parts</strong> across sets to craft custom decks that suits your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different - swap parts between runs, with <strong>endless synergies to discover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" width=1170 height=766 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.webm?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/8c832d7d1e9d0b9cb827ad591d34f721.mp4?t=1787910796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MECHBORN</strong> replaces the traditional hand of cards with the <strong>Conveyor Belt: a flowing queue of 7 cards</strong> to fuel countless possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new card slides in every time one is played, so you <strong>never run out of options</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always plan ahead - with <strong>7 cards always available</strong>, your next move is never a mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use pilot skills to reposition cards</strong> - setting up devastating combos before you need them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/extras/f2bbbe62ce955b3b5eea8cc6b285d67f.poster.avif?t=1787910796\" w