b_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A fresh roguelike deckbuilder where YOUR MECH IS YOUR DECK – With 7 cards always in play on a conveyor belt victory is down to skill and not luck. Master pilot skills and unlock Mech parts to reveal powerful cards, as you carve your path across 3 ever-changing continents to repel the Kaiju invasion.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Italian", "reviews": "“At first MECHBORN seems like just Slay the Spire in a robot costume, but there's more to it than meets the eye”<br>PC Gamer, Robin Valentine<br><br>“Stack your deck wisely”<br>IGN, Ryan McCaffrey<br><br>“It’s refreshing to see a developer cut through the noise and deliver a genuinely unique take on the formula”<br>Rogueliker, Kieran Harris<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/1fb3412b45ca52f216f70804caac7693465ae540/header.jpg?t=1787910796", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/9e75c2cb176bcde84b6a31cf50995c5e47d401fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787910796", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/9e75c2cb176bcde84b6a31cf50995c5e47d401fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787910796", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit) or later <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 (8*2900)/AMD Ryzen 5 2600 (6*3400) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Ti (6144 MB)/Radeon RX Vega 56 (8192 MB) or higher <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> (Current specs apply to the playtest only and are not reflective of the final product)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i9-10700 (8*3000/16*2200)/MD Ryzen 5 9600X (6*3900) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 ti (24576 MB)/Radeon RX 9060XT (16384 MB) or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> (Current specs apply to the playtest only and are not reflective of the final product)</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Turtle Juice"], "publishers": ["Curve Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/f600e3f8149fe99d2d3dc39d26984de114883a1e/ss_f600e3f8149fe99d2d3dc39d26984de114883a1e.600x338.jpg?t=1787910796", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/f600e3f8149fe99d2d3dc39d26984de114883a1e/ss_f600e3f8149fe99d2d3dc39d26984de114883a1e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787910796"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/086f6ed42292f3d9e7329226baac17ea42e18dcf/ss_086f6ed42292f3d9e7329226baac17ea42e18dcf.600x338.jpg?t=1787910796", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531220/086f6ed42292f3d9e7329226baac17ea42e18dcf/ss_086f6ed42292f3d9e7329226baac17ea42e18dcf.19